  message: "Struct designated initializer function pointer tracking merged in PR #2402. Detects .field = func patterns in C struct initializers and creates dispatches_to edges. Records field name in meta for future indirect call resolution. Combined with existing dispatch table detection, this should reduce the C orphan rate in callback-heavy codebases like haproxy."  # a6de
